# Changes to exynos5515-freshbl_defconfig (SM-R870) and
# exynos5515-freshbs_defconfig (SM-R860) for bootloader rev2.
#
# The hypervisor clients are off: the rev2 bootloader runs a newer uH whose
# KDP interface differs from the 4.19 one (application id and command
# numbers changed), and whose RKP has the 5.15 kernel memory layout built
# in (linear map in the lower half of the kernel VA space), so a 4.19 kernel
# with RKP stops before its first log line. Each line is applied with
# scripts/config --disable.
UH
RKP
KDP
KDP_CRED
KDP_NS
KDP_DMAP
